01:21.159 --> 01:23.159
Negative 3 degrees Celsius

01:23.920 --> 01:27.809
So it was negative 3 degrees Celsius, at the beginning of the day

01:27.810 --> 01:32.100
Yeah, that's a true statement and especially if you consider the beginning of the day, the true beginning of the day is right at midnight

01:32.619 --> 01:33.729
so

01:33.729 --> 01:37.169
